{"id":"3dd3a38d0a4f5c6c","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-simple-index-complete.md","title":"简单集指标的 Π₃ 完全性","display":"thm-simple-index-complete — 简单集指标的 Π₃ 完全性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-simple-index-complete","aliases":["20-thm-simple-index-complete"],"display":"thm-simple-index-complete — 简单集指标的 Π₃ 完全性","chapter":"5","section":"5.2.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 5.2.10；Theorem 5.2.5；Theorem 4.3.3","source_printed_pages":[110,113,87,88],"source_pdf_pages":[145,148,123,124],"depends_on":["[[20-df-simple]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-df-sigma-complete]]","[[20-df-movable-markers]]","[[20-thm-cof-complexity]]","[[20-thm-canonical-simple-set]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-lem-padding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-simple-index-complete"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-simple-index-complete</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-simple-index-complete — 简单集指标的 Π₃ 完全性"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.2.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 5.2.10；Theorem 5.2.5；Theorem 4.3.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>110</span><span>113</span><span>87</span><span>88</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>145</span><span>148</span><span>123</span><span>124</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" href=\"?note=466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" title=\"20-df-movable-markers\">20-df-movable-markers</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1e47661fa15be194\" href=\"?note=1e47661fa15be194\" title=\"20-thm-cof-complexity\">20-thm-cof-complexity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2a3b5d1c6d48163f\" href=\"?note=2a3b5d1c6d48163f\" title=\"20-thm-canonical-simple-set\">20-thm-canonical-simple-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Simp}:=\\{e:\\operatorname{Simple}(W_e)\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Simp}:=\\{e:\\operatorname{Simple}(W_e)\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}\">\\(W_{e,s}\\)</span> 为有限阶段枚举，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Complete}_m\">\\(\\operatorname{Complete}_m\\)</span> 是算术层级中的多一完备性。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"428fc565e7338639\" href=\"?note=428fc565e7338639\" title=\"20-df-simple\">20-df-simple</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"422e06e55bbb8b2f\" href=\"?note=422e06e55bbb8b2f\" title=\"20-df-sigma-complete\">20-df-sigma-complete</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" href=\"?note=466c9d0fec2ff1b3\" title=\"20-df-movable-markers\">20-df-movable-markers</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"1e47661fa15be194\" href=\"?note=1e47661fa15be194\" title=\"20-thm-cof-complexity\">20-thm-cof-complexity</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"2a3b5d1c6d48163f\" href=\"?note=2a3b5d1c6d48163f\" title=\"20-thm-canonical-simple-set\">20-thm-canonical-simple-set</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"743a0376168bb7ec\" href=\"?note=743a0376168bb7ec\" title=\"20-lem-padding\">20-lem-padding</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple-index-complete}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Simp},\\Pi^0_3).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}simple-index-complete}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Complete}_m(\\mathrm{Simp},\\Pi^0_3).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>上界的两个条件为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall n\\ \\exists x&gt;n\\ \\forall s\\ [x\\notin W_{e,s}],\\\\\n\\forall j\\ \\left[(\\exists m\\ \\forall s\\ |W_{j,s}|\\le m)\\lor\n(\\exists s\\ W_{j,s}\\cap W_{e,s}\\ne\\varnothing)\\right].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\forall n\\ \\exists x&gt;n\\ \\forall s\\ [x\\notin W_{e,s}],\\\\\n\\forall j\\ \\left[(\\exists m\\ \\forall s\\ |W_{j,s}|\\le m)\\lor\n(\\exists s\\ W_{j,s}\\cap W_{e,s}\\ne\\varnothing)\\right].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第一式是余无限，第二式说每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_j\">\\(W_j\\)</span> 有限或被击中。括号内是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2\">\\(\\Sigma_2\\)</span>，于是合取是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_3\">\\(\\Pi_3\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 的 c.e. 性由编号保证。</p>\n<p>给任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\Pi_3\">\\(P\\in\\Pi_3\\)</span>，按 Cof 证明的统一矩阵编译取得 c.e. 踢集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_y^x\">\\(V_y^x\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin P\\iff\\exists y\\,[V_y^x\\text{ 无限}]\">\\(x\\notin P\\iff\\exists y\\,[V_y^x\\text{ 无限}]\\)</span>。固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 构造有限递增 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_s\">\\(B_s\\)</span>，补集标记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_i(s)\">\\(b_i(s)\\)</span>。阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s+1\">\\(s+1\\)</span>，对本阶段开始时的每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\le s\">\\(y\\le s\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_y^x\">\\(V_y^x\\)</span> 有新成员则删除标记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_y(s)\">\\(b_y(s)\\)</span>。同时搜索最小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e&lt;s\">\\(e&lt;s\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}\\cap B_s=\\varnothing\">\\(W_{e,s}\\cap B_s=\\varnothing\\)</span> 且某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ge e\">\\(i\\ge e\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_i(s)\">\\(b_i(s)\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}\">\\(W_{e,s}\\)</span>；若存在再删除最小这样的标记。所有候选以阶段开始时的标记计算，重复删除只算枚举同一个数，故这是统一 c.e. 构造。</p>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin P\">\\(x\\notin P\\)</span>，某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 的踢集无限，使第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 个标记趋于无穷，最终补集至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 个成员，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 余有限，因而不简单。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in P\">\\(x\\in P\\)</span>，所有踢集有限。归纳第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 个标记：低位稳定后，只受本位有限次踢动，以及简单要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\le n\">\\(e\\le n\\)</span> 的至多一次行动影响；高位删除不影响它。于是各标记稳定，补集无限。每个无限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span> 若未被击中，取其中一个最终补集成员 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_i\">\\(b_i\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\ge e\">\\(i\\ge e\\)</span>，等到它稳定并出现、较小简单要求最后行动之后，要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span> 必行动，矛盾。所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 简单。</p>\n<p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in P\\iff B_x\">\\(x\\in P\\iff B_x\\)</span> 简单。s-m-n 及 padding 可给全可计算单射指标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x)\">\\(f(x)\\)</span>，证明困难性乃至一一困难性；与上界合得所示完全性。这里只用踢集的无限/有限二分，不沿用原书习题提示中指向 Theorem 4.3.9 的编号：实际 Cof 移动标记证明是 4.3.3。</p>\n<p>来源：习题印刷 113 / PDF 148；组合构造来源印刷 110、87–88 / PDF 145、123–124。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-simple","status":"resolved","id":"428fc565e7338639","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-simple]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-sigma-complete","status":"resolved","id":"422e06e55bbb8b2f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-sigma-complete]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-movable-markers","status":"resolved","id":"466c9d0fec2ff1b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","ex